window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I used to think surviving the worst was the hard part. But no one talks about what comes after.</b></p> <p>Learning to trust. To breathe without flinching. To be held without expecting to break.</p> <p>My Alphas saved me. Claimed me. Wrapped me in the kind of love I never believed I'd have. Every day, I wake tangled in their arms with their scents on my skin and their bonds wrapped tight around my soul. And for the first time in years, I feel safe. Whole. Even happy.</p> <p>But the past doesn't let go so easily. When the threats in the shadows become real and the monsters show their faces, they make one fatal mistake: they underestimate me and my mates.</p> <p>I'm not the same girl who was once too broken to fight. This time, I won't wait to be rescued. This time, I will fight back. Because I finally have something to live for. A pack worth bleeding for. A future worth burning the world down to protect.</p> <p>And if the monsters think they can break me again? They'll learn what happens when an Omega learns to bite back.</p> <p>Knot Made to Break: Part Two <i>is the final book in a reverse harem (MFMMM) contemporary Omegaverse duet with no choosing, no cheating, and a guaranteed HEA! For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
